# Killian's Confidence: it triggers only for combat damage dealt to a player. Bot2's Ornithopter blocks the Inkmage, takes the damage
# and dies, so Bot1 is never asked to pay and the Confidence stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Plains
Imperious Inkmage
Killian's Confidence
Plains x2
Plains x3
Island
Plains x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mountain x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Imperious Inkmage.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Plains; Plains | )
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Killian's Confidence.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Imperious Inkmage)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Imperious Inkmage > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Imperious Inkmage)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Killian's Confidence
Stack.Count = 0
